%% Multi-Tenant Request Lifecycle — PROPOSED flow

sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant NX as Next.js
  participant M as Tenant middleware PROPOSED
  participant S as Application service
  participant R as RLS
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>NX: request with session cookie
  NX->>M: resolve active university
  M->>DB: university membership check
  DB-->>M: member / not member
  M-->>NX: tenant context (deny if none)
  NX->>S: process with tenant ctx
  S->>DB: tenant-aware query
  DB->>R: RLS university_id check
  R-->>DB: pass / deny
  DB-->>U: response (tenant-namespaced cache)
